    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1385">

                <pb facs="1354" n="1344" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1344"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.1115/9–1949: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Strong</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-19T19:00:00-04:00">September 19,
                            1949—7 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>TelCan 689. Pls communicate soon as feasible to FonOff as for its info Dept’s
                    statement re present status <hi rendition="#italic">Gen Gordon</hi>’s Shanghai
                    call and take any final steps necessary finally to confirm to Nats details <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gen Gordon</hi>’s Shanghai call. (Subj of immed
                    preceding msg.<anchor n="68" xml:id="d1385-f1"/>)</p>
                <p>For ur confid info: Dept has informed APL that it has clrd the voyage. Other
                    interested Govt agencies have concurred this clearance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
